\cf0 /NIMBLE Simulation/2_marker/ Nimble_single_marker_sim.R -
\f0\b0  This is a script for simulating and estimating DNA concentrations from  metabarcoding data from two marker simultaneously. It can be modified to simulate an arbitrary number of species and metabarcoding replicates, following user specified observation dynamics. A NIMBLE model is defined and run within the script (Model A in Supplement S1).
